---
title: Cluster Centroid Refresh Cycle
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as ClusterRepository (scheduled)
    participant Storage as PostgreSQL
    participant MV as Materialized View (centroids)

    loop After clustering operations
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: refresh_centroids()
        alt refresh needed
            Scheduler->>Storage: get identity_members with embeddings
            Storage-->>Scheduler: cluster members
            Scheduler->>MV: REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW mv_identity_cluster_centroids
            MV-->>Scheduler: updated centroids
        else skip
            Scheduler-->>Scheduler: no-op (no new members)
        end
    end
